OL,3,AWe are behind you and that will not
OL,4,Achange, PM tells Zelensky
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are behind you and that will not
OL,7,Fchange," Andy Burnham has told
OL,8,FVolodymyr Zelensky, as he hosted the
OL,9,FUkrainian leader in Downing Street.
OL,11,FZelensky was in London as part of
OL,12,Fefforts to reinforce backing from
OL,13,Fallies after Donald Trump called for
OL,14,Fhim to go and lifted sanctions on
OL,15,FRussian diesel.
OL,17,FThe prime minister said Ukraine was
OL,18,Fwilling to discuss an energy ceasefire
OL,19,Fproposed by the US president but said
OL,20,FRussia's response had been "further
OL,21,Fattacks on critical national
OL,22,Finfrastructure in Ukraine".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
