OL,3,AWe are behind you and that will not
OL,4,Achange, PM tells Zelensky
OL,5,
OL,6,FZelensky said: "Our people, we survived
OL,7,Fand continue to do this because we have
OL,8,Fstrong partners and I'm very proud that
OL,9,Fwe have one of the strongest partners
OL,10,Fin our history and it's your people,
OL,11,FAndy."
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
