OL,3,AGermany puts Ukrainian on trial accused
OL,4,Aof blowing up Nord Stream pipelines
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Ukrainian man has gone on trial in
OL,7,FHamburg accused of blowing up Russia's
OL,8,FNord Stream gas pipelines to Germany,
OL,9,Ffour years after one of the most
OL,10,Fdramatic acts of sabotage in modern
OL,11,FEuropean history.
OL,13,FProsecutors say Serhii Kuznetsov played
OL,14,Fa leading role in a team of saboteurs
OL,15,Fthat destroyed the pipelines, accusing
OL,16,Fhim of a war crime. His defence has
OL,17,Fcalled for the case to be dismissed.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
